                "script": "\t\"\"\"\n\tSection button onClick - trigger accordion toggle.\n\t\n\tExtracts section index from component name and calls\n\ttoggleFlexRoot on root. Works regardless of hierarchy.\n\t\n\tVersion: 1.1.0\n\t\n\tArgs:\n\t\tself (Component): Reference to Section component\n\t\n\tReturns:\n\t\tNone: Triggers toggleFlexRoot on root\n\t\n\tChangelog:\n\t\t2026-07-05 | William | v1.0.0 - Initial version\n\t\t2026-07-05 | William | v1.1.0 - Dynamic, hierarchy-independent\n\t\"\"\"\n\t\n\t# Extract section index from component name\n\tsectionIndex \u003d int(self.meta.name.replace(\"Section\", \"\"))\n\t\n\t# Trigger accordion toggle on root\n\tself.view.getChild(\"root\").toggleFlexRoot(sectionIndex)\n\t    "
